        "id": "06091a8d-ac23-4eb1-abc0-b9cafab33eb7",
        "content": "Provides an example voicemail experience for customers already in queue. This flow module handles the initialization of Automated Interaction Recording, configuration of the minimum flags required to process the voicemail, and provides the customer experience. This module can be invoked from any normal contact flow.\n\nThe following attributes MUST have been defined previously:\n\nvmx3_mode\nvmx3_from\nvmx3_lang\nvmx3_queue_arn",
